  "aiBuilt": true,
  "knownIssues": [
    "Brand new and experimental, so expect rough edges.",
    "This is a different ValCraft from LoAlCo's. The two can't be installed at the same time, because both load into Valheim.",
    "Valheim runs on DirectX 11 while you play this. If Steam asks how to start Valheim, pick the normal option, not Vulkan.",
    "Valheim's ground, trees, rocks, buildings and creatures hide Minecraft's blocks behind them; grass and leaves don't.",
    "Sometimes Minecraft shows the default skin instead of yours, when Minecraft's skin service is slow. Playing again usually fixes it.",
    "On very big screens (1440p and 4K) it can stutter. A lower Valheim resolution makes it smoother.",
    "Made for single-player."
  ]
}
